      "messages": {
        "202110000": {
          "id": 202110000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "My Dux, I am preparing for my first \"Extreme Expedition\"",
          "next": [
            202110001
          ]
        },
        "202110001": {
          "id": 202110001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "As one who has journeyed across the stars, you would surely provide more complete advice",
          "next": [
            202110002,
            202110004,
            202110005
          ]
        },
        "202110002": {
          "id": 202110002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Going alone? Where are you headed?",
          "next": [
            202110003
          ]
        },
        "202110003": {
          "id": 202110003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "If someone wants to come along, I have no objections",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110004": {
          "id": 202110004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Where are you headed?",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110005": {
          "id": 202110005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Feel free to board the Astral Express",
          "next": [
            202110006
          ]
        },
        "202110006": {
          "id": 202110006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "A possible stop, perhaps. But not now",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110007": {
          "id": 202110007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "Amphoreus, in the future",
          "next": [
            202110008
          ]
        },
        "202110008": {
          "id": 202110008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "On my past conquests, I remember the states only as raging fires of strife or the stagnant, black tide of death",
          "next": [
            202110009
          ]
        },
        "202110009": {
          "id": 202110009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "When the Seed of Memory blossoms, Amphoreus will burst with life. A perfect time for me to explore it",
          "next": [
            202110010
          ]
        },
        "202110010": {
          "id": 202110010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "I wish to sail the Skiana seas, where the storm clouds and giant waves are locked in eternal combat",
          "next": [
            202110011
          ]
        },
        "202110011": {
          "id": 202110011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "Have you heard of Ladon? It's said there's a peak there so high it touches the clouds",
          "next": [
            202110012
          ]
        },
        "202110012": {
          "id": 202110012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "I'm trying to decide between wingsuit flying and skydiving",
          "next": [
            202110013
          ]
        },
        "202110013": {
          "id": 202110013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "Any advice, dear Dux?",
          "next": [
            202110014,
            202110016,
            202110019
          ]
        },
        "202110014": {
          "id": 202110014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Either one works. I mean, I do make a habit of spinning, jumping, and dropping into worlds from way up high",
          "next": [
            202110015
          ]
        },
        "202110015": {
          "id": 202110015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "Excellent proposition",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110016": {
          "id": 202110016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "It's a long story... but my usual method of entering a world is by falling into it",
          "next": [
            202110017
          ]
        },
        "202110017": {
          "id": 202110017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You should give it a go",
          "next": [
            202110018
          ]
        },
        "202110018": {
          "id": 202110018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "Excellent proposition",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110019": {
          "id": 202110019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Please, stay safe!",
          "next": [
            202110020
          ]
        },
        "202110020": {
          "id": 202110020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "Relax. The Imperator is made of tough stuff",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110021": {
          "id": 202110021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "I just had wilderness survival training with the little kitten and rope-making class with Dux Goldweaver",
          "next": [
            202110022
          ]
        },
        "202110022": {
          "id": 202110022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "Now it's time for my swimming lessons with Dux Gladiorum",
          "next": [
            202110023
          ]
        },
        "202110023": {
          "id": 202110023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "See you later",
          "next": []
        }
